# This backend is deployed as its OWN Vercel project (root directory = repo
# root, entry point = index.js via vercel.json). The frontend (client/) is
# deployed as a SEPARATE Vercel project with its root directory set to
# `client`. Excluding client/ here keeps the backend function bundle small
# and avoids uploading the frontend's own (much larger) node_modules/build
# artifacts into a deployment that never serves them.
#
# NOTE: this file only matters for the split-deploy path. If you instead
# deploy this app the traditional way (single Node process, SERVE_CLIENT_BUILD
# left at its default) on a non-Vercel host, this file is irrelevant there.
client/
